## Goal

Each lazy screen's `import()` moves into one map, `routeChunks`, in a new file `apps/web/src/routes/chunks.tsx`. Each chunk has a single `load`, and both `main.tsx`'s route table and `prefetchRoute(path)` call it, so a prefetch and the route share one request.

- **When:** a capture-phase listener installed by `App` prefetches on `pointerenter`, `focus` and `touchstart` of in-app links and of buttons that carry `data-route`. Each route is prefetched once per page load.
